@startuml diagrama-apply

title PreviewPanda — Secuencia de preview.yml (apply)

actor Desarrollador as Dev
participant "GitHub\n(Pull Request)" as PR
participant "GitHub Actions" as GA
participant "AWS IAM\n(OIDC)" as IAM
participant "ECR" as ECR
participant "Terraform" as TF
participant "Lambda" as Lambda
participant "S3\n(state)" as S3
participant "CloudWatch" as CW
participant "Rama registro/environments" as CSV

Dev -> PR : abre, actualiza o reabre
PR -> GA : dispara preview.yml
GA -> IAM : asume el rol previewpanda-ci por OIDC
IAM --> GA : credenciales temporales
GA -> ECR : login
GA -> ECR : el tag pr-<n>-<sha7> ya existe?
opt El tag todavia no existe
  GA -> GA : construye la imagen de app/
  GA -> ECR : publica la imagen
end
GA -> TF : init con el state del PR
TF -> S3 : lee previews/pr-<n>/terraform.tfstate
GA -> TF : plan\n(env_name, commit_sha, image_uri)
GA -> TF : apply del plan generado
TF -> IAM : gestiona rol pp-pr-<n>-lambda-exec
TF -> CW : gestiona log group (7 dias)
TF -> Lambda : crea o actualiza funcion y Function URL
TF --> S3 : guarda state
TF --> GA : output function_url
GA -> CSV : scripts/registrar_entorno.sh\n(created o updated)
GA -> PR : scripts/comentario_pr.js\n(URL, imagen y resumen del plan)

@enduml
